<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#07152f">
<title>Sila Store</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg,#10264a,#07152f,#030b19);
  color: white;
  min-height: 100vh;
  text-align: center;
}

header {
  padding: 45px 15px 20px;
}

.logo {
  font-family: Georgia,serif;
  font-size: 43px;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
  font-weight: normal;
}

.line {
  width: 55px;
  height: 1px;
  background: #c8a96b;
  margin: 15px auto;
}

.subtitle {
  color: #d5bd8a;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

main {
  min-height: 65vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 20px;
}

.small {
  color: #c8a96b;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

h2 {
  font-family: Georgia,serif;
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: normal;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

h2 span {
  color: #e5d0a0;
}

.whatsapp-circle {
  width: 115px;
  height: 115px;
  margin-top: 30px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #25D366;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 57px;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px #25d36615;
}

.label {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

footer {
  color: #888;
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 25px;
}

.bottom {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 15px;
  left: 15px;
  right: 15px;
}

.button {
  display: block;
  background: #25D366;
  color: white;
  padding: 18px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">Sila Store</div>
  <div class="line"></div>
  <div class="subtitle">ELEVATED EXPERIENCE</div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="small">تواصل مباشر</div>

  <h2>
    اكتشف المزيد<br>
    <span>وتواصل معنا مباشرة</span>
  </h2>

  <a class="whatsapp-circle"
     href="https://wa.me/972566569109"
     aria-label="واتساب">
     ☎
  </a>

  <div class="label">اضغط هنا</div>
</main>

<footer>
  Sila Store · ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
</footer>

<div class="bottom">
  <a class="button"
     href="https://wa.me/972566569109">
     ☎ راسلنا واتساب
  </a>
</div>

</body>
</html>
